# Agent workflow

Generated by `/setup`. Skills read this file after `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`.

Preset: {{PRESET}}

## Git

- branch-owner: {{BRANCH_OWNER}}   <!-- agent | human -->
- push: {{PUSH}}                   <!-- finalize | never -->

**branch-owner: agent** — fetch origin; create the Delivery branch from `origin/<default>` (`--no-track`); if it exists, checkout + pull --rebase. Never create from HEAD.

**branch-owner: human** — agent stays on current branch; never checkout or create. User creates branch before `/implement`.

**push: finalize** — `/verify` with branch-owner agent: push, watch CI, open PR.

**push: never** — branch-owner human: agent does not push; user opens the PR.

Priority: PRD `## Delivery` overrides > this file > setup preset.

